{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1476877-for-fun-pocket-dimension-sanctum","id":1476877,"title":"For Fun - Pocket Dimension Sanctum","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Mage: The Awakening"],"posts":[{"date":"2022-03-21T13:37:53-07:00","id":1476877,"title":"For Fun - Pocket Dimension Sanctum","content":"Simple premise - you've done a service for a master of Space and Matter, and as a reward they've offered to create a pocket dimension for you. Using Matter (and any other plausible arcana you name) as a conjunctive effect, they will make as close an approximation to your wishes as they can. What kind of sanctum will you ask for? <br /> <br /> Parameters: the Master has Space and Matter 5, and all other arcana at 2. Gnosis is 6. The spell is Indefinite. The Scale of the spell is set to Advanced and the dice pool is large enough to accommodate the maximum, if you choose to go that large.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">Monkish Asexual.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1490057-cauthon-s-homebrew-hub#post1490057\" target=\"_blank\">My homebrew hub</a><br /> <br /> Mostly checked out, there's an uncomfortable amount of condescension in the old guard.</div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27258-cauthon","name":"Cauthon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27258_4.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1780"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-03-21T16:07:17-07:00","id":1476895,"title":"","content":"With some Prime, and Mind, I would see if we could make the space a place of Peace, Empathy, Growth, Compassion, and Contemplation. I think I would like to shape my soul to more embody those things, and I would like a space where that is more possible. A connection to the Astral so I may visit my Oneiros might be harder to pull off. My personal preferred aesthetic is a relatively normal home suspended in a void of stardust and motes of light. I will probably bring in flowers, and see if I can drag in a Node to tinker with. Frankly, I\u2019d work more on the space being as being as hard to dispel or destroy as possible.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>To whomever reads this, I hope you have a good day/night. May you be Happy.<br /> <br /> So, I made some Mage Legacies <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1497183-templebuilder-s-new-legacy-thread#post1497183\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>, with some help. They vary in quality, but I hope you take a look at them. Every one contains pieces of me, for better or worse.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26736-templebuilder","name":"TempleBuilder","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26736_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1251"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-03-21T16:25:50-07:00","id":1476898,"title":"","content":"A cornucopia of petty material luxuries.<br /> <br /> Hey, they say \u201cFrom the barn/lumberroom/warehouse comes generosity/charity\u201d where I live.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>MtAw Homebrew:<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1051456-even-more-legacies-updated-to-2e#post1051456\" target=\"_blank\">Even more Legacies, updated to 2E</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1443819-new-2e-legacies-expanded\" target=\"_blank\">New 2E Legacies, expanded</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12619-21c-hermit","name":"21C Hermit","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12619_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3489"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-03-21T18:21:45-07:00","id":1476908,"title":"","content":"Gonna lean hard into the stated purpose of a sanctum and the capabilities of a Master of Matter and say &quot;giant sandbox,&quot; for a reasonably broad definition of &quot;sand.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-03-22T09:15:32-07:00","id":1476970,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TempleBuilder</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1476877-for-fun-pocket-dimension-sanctum?p=1476895#post1476895\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">My personal preferred aesthetic is a relatively normal home suspended in a void of stardust and motes of light. I will probably bring in flowers, and see if I can drag in a Node to tinker with. Frankly, I\u2019d work more on the space being as being as hard to dispel or destroy as possible.</div> </div> </div> </div>That sounds pretty! Would you be able to walk out the door? Is there a yard? could you go to the &quot;underside&quot; of the structure?<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>21C Hermit</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1476877-for-fun-pocket-dimension-sanctum?p=1476898#post1476898\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">A cornucopia of petty material luxuries.<br /> <br /> Hey, they say \u201cFrom the barn/lumberroom/warehouse comes generosity/charity\u201d where I live.</div> </div> </div> </div>Kegs of endless beer? Gardens of everblooming orchids? Certainly appealing, regardless of how you set it up.<br /> <br /> \u200b <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Satchel</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1476877-for-fun-pocket-dimension-sanctum?p=1476908#post1476908\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Gonna lean hard into the stated purpose of a sanctum and the capabilities of a Master of Matter and say &quot;giant sandbox,&quot; for a reasonably broad definition of &quot;sand.&quot;</div> </div> </div> </div>Heh, my first though was of an endless plain of sand, and how it'd be the perfect defense against traitorous apprentices. Who wants to deal with something so coarse and grainy, that gets everywhere?<br /> But it'd be a primordial chaos, that you could impose your will on?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">Monkish Asexual.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1490057-cauthon-s-homebrew-hub#post1490057\" target=\"_blank\">My homebrew hub</a><br /> <br /> Mostly checked out, there's an uncomfortable amount of condescension in the old guard.</div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27258-cauthon","name":"Cauthon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27258_4.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1780"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-03-22T11:16:25-07:00","id":1476986,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Cauthon</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1476877-for-fun-pocket-dimension-sanctum?p=1476970#post1476970\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">That sounds pretty!</div> </div> </div> </div> Thank you!<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Cauthon</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1476877-for-fun-pocket-dimension-sanctum?p=1476970#post1476970\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Would you be able to walk out the door?</div> </div> </div> </div>I would have a door that one could walk out of to explore the void, but one might need some Forces to get around easily.<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Cauthon</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1476877-for-fun-pocket-dimension-sanctum?p=1476970#post1476970\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Is there a yard?</div> </div> </div> </div> Yes! I would need somewhere to grow a garden, after all. It might not be attached to the house though, perhaps on a a small planetoid not too far from the house. <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Cauthon</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1476877-for-fun-pocket-dimension-sanctum?p=1476970#post1476970\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">could you go to the &quot;underside&quot; of the structure?</div> </div> </div> </div> Yes. I think I would make gravity be strange, facing the floor inside the house and being more minimal on the outside. I assume I\u2019d be a Obrimos*, so I would probably do this part myself.<br /> <br /> <br /> * Probably, anyways. Both Forces and Truth have always been dear to my heart, and my personal flaws are extremely similar to flaws of the path in general. At least, I believe so. Others might disagree I suppose.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>To whomever reads this, I hope you have a good day/night. May you be Happy.<br /> <br /> So, I made some Mage Legacies <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1497183-templebuilder-s-new-legacy-thread#post1497183\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>, with some help. They vary in quality, but I hope you take a look at them. Every one contains pieces of me, for better or worse.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26736-templebuilder","name":"TempleBuilder","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26736_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1251"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-03-22T18:02:47-07:00","id":1477041,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Cauthon</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1476877-for-fun-pocket-dimension-sanctum?p=1476970#post1476970\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">But it'd be a primordial chaos, that you could impose your will on?</div> </div> </div> </div>Practice field full of particulates of varying compositions, with a few tanks of various types of liquids.<br /> <br /> Primordial chaos would be what I'd ask for if I were dealing with someone who could credibly seek the Threshold. I can do plenty with a campus-sized chemistry set with assorted rocks and minerals.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-03-26T02:30:27-07:00","id":1477423,"title":"","content":"I would take a mundane sanctum and co-locate it into the pocket dimension. (Ie no need for matter). I would want an Artifact/imbued item which swaps time in the sanctum (or just the entrance way) from 'flowing as normal' to shielded* to no time.<br /> <br /> I would want a very large space with a banned portal which only allows sunlight in opening to somewhere on the moon. Connecting the pocket dimension's sky to the dark side of the moon. Then co-locate a bunch of soil, water and plants to absorbs the sunlight and produce oxygen. <br /> <br /> There is no twilight for death, spirit or mind here. But i will need to find a master of Prime to create a Hallow and possibly an Eidolon. <br /> <br /> Lastly, i will want to destroy all sympathic connections to and from this place that i can find... For security. And ward+veil (prime) the spell creating it...<br /> <br /> *That is the effect of veil of moments.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27248-orathaic","name":"orathaic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27248_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1032"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}